			"notes": "- Added green Wand.\n- Changed recipe of purple Wand to use 1 moonstone, purple dye and a stick instead of a moonstone block.\n- Now Wands with Lumos illuminate you just for having them in your Inventory, so you don't go full dark when switching your hand to a pickaxe while mining,\n- Fixed banners with this mod's custom patterns on shields. They were showing full black, now they show up properly.\n- Now shields also protect from Spells, just like Protego. And just like Protego, you can shield yourself from a direct cast, but not a explosion/fire happening nearby by Spells. Bombarda and Incendio recommended for PVP I guess.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Cristichi/MagiaBorrasFabric/compare/v1.1.0...v1.1.1"
		},
